"""The dashboard page: one self-contained HTML document (no outside files, no tracking). Four places on a bottom bar, designed so a business owner can set everything up alone:
Home: your day at a glance (handled, needs you, orders), approvals, phrases to review, a box to ask your assistant, the latest activity.
Connect: three parts. Apps (what is connected, add more), Assistant (chat with your own AI and what it knows about your business), Orders (tracking links, saved).
Library: your phrases (saved, to review), add your own, missing phrases.
Settings: ask before sending, AI conversations and safeguards, saved automations, missing phrase requests, locations and licence, your account, pause."""

